==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Slavic|čьto|what|lang=sh}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|kʷid|lang=sh}}; compare Čakavian {{term|ča|čȁ|what|lang=sh}} (< {{proto|Slavic|čь|lang=sh}}).

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|sh|шта|шта̏}} (pronoun only)

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ʃtô/|lang=sh}}

===Adverb===
{{sh-adverb|head=што̏|c|što|štȍ}}

# [[why]] (short for {{term|зашто|за̏што|lang=sh}})
